Methodology:
CAWI and CATI systems; The representativeness of the sample is ensured by the quota method with regard to the following criteria:
― socio-demographic (sex, age of the individual);
― socio-professional (profession of the individual);
― geographical (region, size of urban unit);
These quotas were defined based on INSEE data for the population aged 18 and over residing in metropolitan France (INSEE RP 2020).

Interview mode: F2F;
Sample type: stratified, probabalistic, tri-stadial;
Sample size: usually 1000-1100 persons aged 18 and over, questions available in Romanian and Russian;
Margin of error: +/- 3.0%

